OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after report of
OL,4,Asuspicious object
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of homes have been evacuated
OL,7,Ffollowing the report of a suspicious
OL,8,Fobject in County Armagh.
OL,10,FPolice are currently in attendance at
OL,11,Fthe scene in the Prince's Close area of
OL,12,FLurgan.
OL,14,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,15,F(PSNI) said motorists are advised to
OL,16,Favoid the area.
OL,18,FSinn Fein councillor Chloe Devine said:
OL,19,F"Residents are asked to remain patient,
OL,20,Fallow emergency services to deal with
OL,21,Fthe situation and follow guidance from
OL,22,FPSNI."
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
